---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Md. Farhatul Abrar"
  description="Md. Farhatul Abrar is a Lecturer in Chemical Engineering at BUET, working on hydrothermal carbonization, life-cycle assessment, and multiscale process modeling."
>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p class="bio">
      I am a Lecturer in Chemical Engineering at Bangladesh University of
      Engineering and Technology (BUET). My research background is in
      hydrothermal carbonization and life-cycle assessment of waste-to-energy
      processes. I am now expanding my research into multiscale process
      modeling and molecular simulation, with a current focus on reactive
      molecular dynamics using LAMMPS and ReaxFF. My broader goal is to
      connect molecular-level chemistry with process-scale optimization to
      enable more sustainable process design.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">M.Sc. in Chemical Engineering</span>
            <span class="entry-date">January 2025</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET)</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">B.Sc. in Chemical Engineering</span>
            <span class="entry-date">May 2023</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET)</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Academic Experience</h2>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">Lecturer</span>
            <span class="entry-date">May 2025 – Present</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Department of Chemical Engineering, BUET</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">Research Assistant</span>
            <span class="entry-date">July 2023 – December 2024</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Department of Chemical Engineering, BUET</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .page {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 24px 120px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 32px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .bio {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0 0 56px;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .entry-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .entry-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .entry-title {
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .entry-date {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .entry-meta {
      display: block;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>